  "questions": [
    {"diff_label": "41", "stem": "一项工作甲独立完成需要3小时，乙独立完成的用时比其与甲合作完成多4小时，且乙和丙合作完成需要4小时。问：丙独立完成需要多少小时？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "10", "B": "12", "C": "6", "D": "8"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "41", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 54}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "42", "stem": "工厂生产甲、乙两种设备，需要用到A、B、C三种零件。其中生产1台甲设备需要5个A零件和11个B零件，生产1台乙设备需要4个B零件和9个C零件。工厂某日生产的一批设备共用A、B、C三种零件不超过200个，其中C零件的用量超过100个。问：最多可能生产了多少台甲设备？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "1", "B": "2", "C": "3", "D": "4"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "42", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 54}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "43", "stem": "一个三角形公园ABC内的道路如下图中实线所示。已知AE=EF=FB，AD=DC，且黑色部分为人工湖。问：公园总面积是人工湖面积的多少倍？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "9", "B": "12", "C": "16", "D": "18"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "43", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 55}}, "flags": ["answer_missing", "media_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "44", "stem": "某单位有甲和乙2个办公室，分别有职工5人和4人。每周从这9名职工中随机抽取1人下沉社区担任志愿者(同一人有可能被连续、重复选中)。问：7月前2周的志愿者均来自甲办公室的概率在以下哪个范围内？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "不到25%", "B": "25%~35%", "C": "35%~45%", "D": "超过45%"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "44", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 55}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "45", "stem": "甲和乙两个实验室共同承接10000份样本的检验工作。甲实验室每小时可检验200份样本，每检验一份样本的费用为100元；乙实验室每小时可检验500份样本，每检验一份样本的费用为200元。问：如要求15小时内检验完毕，最低总检验费用比要求18小时内检验完毕时高多少万元？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "3", "B": "4", "C": "5", "D": "6"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "45", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 55}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "46", "stem": "在一块正方形土地中，画一条经过某个顶点的规划线，将其分割为三角形和梯形两块土地，且梯形土地的面积正好是三角形土地的2倍。问：三角形和梯形土地的周长之比是多少？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "1:2", "B": "5:7", "C": "(1+√5):(2+√5)", "D": "(5+√13):(7+√13)"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "46", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 55}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "47", "stem": "将5个相邻的铺位出租给2家餐厅和2家水果店。要求租完不能有空余铺位，每家餐厅可以租用1个铺位，也可以租用并打通2个相邻的铺位作为其营业场所，每家水果店只能租用1个铺位，且相同类型的两个租户之间至少要间隔1个铺位。问：有多少种不同的安排方式？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "24", "B": "48", "C": "8", "D": "16"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "47", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 55}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "48", "stem": "某次招标活动中，甲、乙、丙、丁、戊和己6家投标企业依次对自己的设计进行讲解。已知甲和乙均不能安排在第一个或最后一个，丙只能安排在第三个或第四个，如在满足以上条件的次序中随机选择一个，则丁和戊的讲解次序相邻的概率为：", "items": null, "options": {"A": "2/9", "B": "1/5", "C": "2/7", "D": "1/4"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "48", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 56}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
    {"diff_label": "49", "stem": "甲、乙、丙三家科技企业2021年的收入之和比2020年提升了20%。其中甲企业的收入上升了400万元，乙企业的收入下降了100万元且是甲企业收入的一半，丙企业的收入上升了30%且其2020年的收入与甲、乙两企业同年收入之和相同。问：2020年甲企业的收入比乙企业高多少万元？", "items": null, "options": {"A": "900", "B": "1100", "C": "400", "D": "600"}, "options_in_media": false, "type": "数量关系", "topic": null, "tag": null, "answer": null, "answer_source": null, "explanation": null, "media": [], "formulas": [], "material_ids": [], "provenance": {"role": "province_only", "from_paper": "shengji", "from_number": null, "diff_label": "49", "raw_note": "省级独有", "source_ref": {"file": "20234972.pdf", "page": 56}}, "flags": ["answer_missing"]},
